(7778711, 1293649, 12200, '<td valign="top">
Sublime execution. It really registers as photorealistic art rather than simply as a photograph--which, in my book, is incredibly difficult to achieve this convincingly.</td>', 'Sublime execution. It really registers as photorealistic art rather than simply as a photograph--which, in my book, is incredibly difficult to achieve this convincingly.', '2025-03-26 23:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7778712, 1293758, 12200, '<td valign="top">
This looks like it would have been captured in autumn rather than springtime. How did you achieve that effect? It''s impressively rendered.
<br/>
<br/>I like how the bare tree toward the left gently becomes the focal point after the overall impression is made. It makes for a surprisingly engaging composition.</td>', 'This looks like it would have been captured in autumn rather than springtime. How did you achieve that effect? It''s impressively rendered.

I like how the bare tree toward the left gently becomes the focal point after the overall impression is made. It makes for a surprisingly engaging composition.', '2025-03-26 23:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7778713, 1293716, 12200, '<td valign="top">
