(7778714, 1293670, 12200, '<td valign="top">
There''s a gentle humor to this composition that I absolutely adore.
<br/>
<br/>I would be interested to see whether this image would work better or worse for me if the people and the dog in the middle ground weren''t there.</td>', 'There''s a gentle humor to this composition that I absolutely adore.

I would be interested to see whether this image would work better or worse for me if the people and the dog in the middle ground weren''t there.', '2025-03-26 23:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7778716, 1293741, 12200, '<td valign="top">
This one feels like the very definition of one way of interpreting this challenge--and one of my top three overall. I would never have seen this and known right away that it was a photograph to begin with. It just feels like a sentimental, artistically compelling visual composition.
<br/>
<br/>For me, this is nearly perfect exactly as it is. But I do wonder if raising the black level would deepen the vignette effect of the shadows at the edges of the composition and really make your subject pop just a bit more.</td>', 'This one feels like the very definition of one way of interpreting this challenge--and one of my top three overall. I would never have seen this and known right away that it was a photograph to begin with. It just feels like a sentimental, artistically compelling visual composition.

For me, this is nearly perfect exactly as it is. But I do wonder if raising the black level would deepen the vignette effect of the shadows at the edges of the composition and really make your subject pop just a bit more.', '2025-03-26 23:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7778717, 1293742, 12200, '<td valign="top">
Oh, wow. This is something special. One of my favorites this challenge, to be sure.
<br/>
<br/>For some reason, when I look at it, I (entirely subjectively) picture the composition cropped a bit more abstractly--perhaps just above the pianist''s chin--hinting more at the energy of the music itself as the subject of the image than the identity of the musician. If that makes sense.</td>', 'Oh, wow. This is something special. One of my favorites this challenge, to be sure.

For some reason, when I look at it, I (entirely subjectively) picture the composition cropped a bit more abstractly--perhaps just above the pianist''s chin--hinting more at the energy of the music itself as the subject of the image than the identity of the musician. If that makes sense.', '2025-03-26 23:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7778718, 1293755, 12200, '<td valign="top">
